## Downloaded model artifacts

The embedding model is sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, with a pinned
Qdrant/all-MiniLM-L6-v2-onnx conversion. Its model card declares Apache-2.0.
The experimental reranker is a pinned Xenova/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 conversion
of the Apache-2.0 cross-encoder model. The conversion card points to its base
model but does not itself include an explicit license field in the retained
card. Preserve conversion/base-model provenance and confirm redistribution
terms before bundling weights. Weights are downloaded separately into ignored
data/ and are excluded from the public source tree.

Pinned revisions/checksums: knowledge/embedding-lock.json and
knowledge/reranker-lock.json. Model cards and upstream notices remain attached
to the separately downloaded artifacts. No Gemini model weights are included.
